          "text": "I searched for online sections only, and very few exist for the courses you still need. The schedule builder also returned campus sections even with the online filter on, so I'm not offering those. Here are the online sections I confirmed (seats as of 2026-11-13 15:00 UTC):\n\n- **CSE 212, Programming with Data Structures (2 cr), section 03.** It fills Data Structures. It is online with no set meeting times. 15 of 40 seats are open.\n- **MATH 113, Calculus II (3 cr), section 04.** It fills Calculus II. It is online with no set meeting times. 22 of 40 seats are open.\n- **MATH 221A, Business Statistics (3 cr), section 03.** It fills Statistics. It is online, in the first block only (W1). 25 of 50 seats are open.\n\nThat adds up to 8 credits.\n\nI found no online sections this term for these requirements:\n- CSE 270\n- CSE 310\n- CSE 340 and CSE 341\n- WDD 231\n- CIT 225\n- the CS electives CSE 325, CSE 381 and CSE 450\n- REL 275\n\nThose would need campus sections, or you could take them in a later term.\n\nWould you like me to build a schedule from the three online classes? Or would you like to add some campus classes?\n\nConfirm with BYU-Idaho Academic Advising.",
